7. Event ID 1102 — Security Log Cleared

Meaning: The Windows Security audit log was cleared.

SOC analyst thinking:

"Why was the Security log cleared, and who cleared it?"

This is important because security logs contain evidence that analysts may need during an investigation.

Remember:

1102 = SECURITY LOG CLEARED 🗑️

